{"unit_id": "tag:0C6J:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个普遍闭（universally closed）态射（morphism）。\n设<MATH_0002>是一个<MATH_0003>-丰沛（ample）的可逆（invertible）<MATH_0004>-模（module）。\n则典范态射（canonical morphism）\n<MATH_0005>\n（由引理<REF_0001>给出）是同构（isomorphism）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "universally closed", "target_term": "普遍闭"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "universally closed", "target_term": "普遍闭", "context": "修饰第一个态射，保留其在任意基变换下的闭性。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指第一句中给定的态射。"}, {"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛", "context": "指该模相对于前述态射的丰沛性。"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "修饰第二句中给定的模。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "指第二句中给定的可逆模。"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射", "context": "指所引引理给出的态射。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "指结论所断言的态射性质。"}], "notes": []}
